From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mitzev <ogi@kunasystems.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Apr 2026 23:23:04 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] ABI plumbing: ExternAbi::Cpp + callconv + stable-rustc bridge

Adds ExternAbi::Cpp and the matching canonicalization path in rustc_abi
and rustc_target. Teaches x86, x86_64, and aarch64 callconv lowering to
thread extern "C++" through the same C calling convention (scalar
params), with the sret/this-pointer hooks reserved for later codegen
commits. Updates rustc_public's stable-API bridge so external tools see
the new variant.
